{"content":[{"c":["SHOBAL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of the seven sons of Seir the Horite in Edom (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.20","r":"Gen.36.20","rawR":"Gen.36.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.20","value":"Gen.36.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.38","r":"1Chr.1.38","rawR":"1Chr.1.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.38","value":"1Chr.1.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:38"},"). Shobal became the father of five sons (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.23","r":"Gen.36.23","rawR":"Gen.36.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.23","value":"Gen.36.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:23"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.40","r":"1Chr.1.40","rawR":"1Chr.1.40","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.40","value":"1Chr.1.40"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:40"},") and a chief among the Horites (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.29","r":"Gen.36.29","rawR":"Gen.36.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.29","value":"Gen.36.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:29"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Hur’s son, the father of Haroeh, and the founder of the families of Kiriath-jearim (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.50-52","r":"1Chr.2.50-52","rawR":"1Chr.2.50-52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.50-52","value":"1Chr.2.50-52"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:50-52"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. One of Judah’s five sons and the father of Reiah (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.1-2","r":"1Chr.4.1-2","rawR":"1Chr.4.1-2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.1-2","value":"1Chr.4.1-2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:1-2"},"); perhaps the same as #2 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Shobal","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 36:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.36.20","rawQueryValue":"Gen.36.20","sourceRefExact":"Gen.36.20"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:38","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":